00:31:27,214 --> 00:31:28,740
包含三样东西
has three things

353
00:31:29,806 --> 00:31:33,732
它有一个名称，对吧？所以第一项，文件的顶部是一个名称，
it has a name, right? So the first thing, the top of the file is a name,

354
00:31:34,510 --> 00:31:36,932
然后接下来是一个描述，
and then after that is a description,

355
00:31:40,174 --> 00:31:43,236
再接着就是……该做什么。
and then after that is uh what to do.

356
00:31:43,822 --> 00:31:54,192
我通常是在做总结，里面有脚本之类的东西，但核心是“要做什么”。这就是技能文件的结构，举个简单的例子，这是我的代码结构技能。
I'm generally summarizing, there's scripts and all that stuff, but it's what to do. This is the structure of a skill file, and to just give a very simple example, this is my code structure skill.

357
00:31:54,272 --> 00:31:56,112
这是我希望代码被书写的方式。
This is how I like my code written.

358
00:31:56,430 --> 00:32:02,148
如果我给你看 Markdown 文件，你会看到有名称、描述，然后是具体的操作步骤。
If I show you the markdown, you see there's name, description, and then how to do set thing.

359
00:32:03,502 --> 00:32:10,052
技能文件有趣的地方在于，整个文件并不会被加入到上下文中。
What's interesting about skill files is that the entire file doesn't get added to the context.

360
00:32:11,072 --> 00:32:13,892
只有名称和描述会被加入进去。
Only the name and the description do.

361
00:32:14,702 --> 00:32:16,832
所以当我创建一个技能文件并把它放入
So when I create a skill file and it's in

362
00:32:17,632 --> 00:32:24,112
框架中时，在上下文窗口里消耗 Token 的只有名称和描述。
the harness, the only thing that gets added in the token in the context window is the name and the description.

363
00:32:24,398 --> 00:32:28,292
现在，迈尔斯或者正在观看的观众可能会问，这有什么关系？
Now, Miles or the audience watching, you might say, why does this matter?

364
00:32:28,622 --> 00:32:30,916
这涉及到 Token 的问题。
It goes back to tokens.

365
00:32:32,270 --> 00:32:34,436
我刚刚粘贴了我的技能文件。
I just pasted my skill file.

366
00:32:34,894 --> 00:32:37,028
迈尔斯，这有多少个 Token？
How many tokens is that, uh, Miles?

