00:32:55,472 --> 00:32:57,092
我需要放大才能操作吗？
do I have to zoom in for it to work?

374
00:32:59,022 --> 00:32:59,940
让我刷新一下，稍等。
Let me refresh, hold on.

375
00:33:00,810 --> 00:33:03,204
让我只复制名称和描述。
And let me just copy name and description.

376
00:33:05,838 --> 00:33:08,128
假设我现在只有名称和描述。
And let's just say I have the name and description.

377
00:33:08,238 --> 00:33:09,316
现在有多少个 Token？
How many tokens now?

378
00:33:09,582 --> 00:33:11,204
53 个。
53 tokens.

379
00:33:11,728 --> 00:33:20,836
所以相比于加载整个文件，只加载名称和描述几乎节省了 900 个 Token。
So we almost saved 900 tokens compared, like when you load in just the name of the description versus loading the entire file.

380
00:33:21,328 --> 00:33:27,968
所以现在我能做的就是，在技能文件中对工作流的不同部分进行结构化处理，对吧？
So now what I can do is I can structure pieces of my workflow in skill files, right?

381
00:33:28,048 --> 00:33:29,604
也就是在 skills.md 文件里。
In skills.md files.

