00:33:29,808 --> 00:33:38,608
然后我的名称和描述需要这样写：当智能体知道它必须执行某个步骤时，它会去读取并寻找那个文件。
And then my name and description need to be written in a way where when the agent knows it has to do a certain step, it reads, it looks for the file.

383
00:33:38,990 --> 00:33:41,248
它什么时候才会加载剩余的内容？
When does it load the rest of the contents?

